cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Australian Racing Open Data
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it. Attribution is the only thing
  asked in return.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: PandaVision
    website: https://github.com/brucem1967/au-racing-open-data
repository-code: https://github.com/brucem1967/au-racing-open-data
abstract: >-
  Open datasets for Australian racing: club- and body-sourced track geometry
  (turn radii, cambers, straight lengths, first-split distances) for greyhound,
  harness and thoroughbred venues; per-run greyhound GPS sectionals from
  Racing Queensland including distance off the rail; Victorian greyhound
  race-day weigh-in weights; and daily weather keyed to venue coordinates.
keywords:
  - horse racing
  - greyhound racing
  - harness racing
  - australia
  - sports analytics
  - open data
  - sectionals
  - track geometry
license: ODC-BY-1.0
